# Requirements Specification

## 1. Introduction

### 1.1 Project Title

Hotel Management System

### 1.2 Purpose

The Hotel Management System is designed to automate hotel operations including room management, customer management, booking management, check-in, check-out, payment processing, and reporting.

### 1.3 Problem Statement

Many hotels still rely on manual processes for handling reservations, customer records, and billing. These methods are slow, error-prone, and difficult to maintain.

### 1.4 Proposed Solution

Develop a Java-based Hotel Management System that stores information electronically and automates daily hotel operations.

---

## 2. Project Objectives

### Main Objective

To develop a Hotel Management System that improves efficiency, accuracy, and management of hotel operations.

### Specific Objectives

- Manage hotel rooms
- Manage customer records
- Handle bookings
- Process check-ins
- Process check-outs
- Manage payments
- Generate reports

---

## 3. Functional Requirements

### Room Management

- Add room
- Update room
- Delete room
- Search room
- View rooms

### Customer Management

- Register customer
- Update customer information
- Search customer
- View customer details

### Booking Management

- Create booking
- Modify booking
- Cancel booking
- Check room availability

### Check-In Management

- Verify booking
- Assign room

### Check-Out Management

- Generate bill
- Process payment
- Free room

### Reporting

- Occupancy reports
- Revenue reports
- Customer history reports

